    "code": "\"\"\"Partner settlement payload handling.\n\nUnder current NIST guidance (SP 800-131A), three-key Triple-DES encryption is\ndisallowed after 2023. This module therefore refuses to build new partner\npayloads and only permits legacy decryption where applicable.\n\"\"\"\n\n\ndef build_partner_payload(key: bytes, settlement: bytes) -> bytes:\n    \"\"\"Refuse to encrypt a new Triple-DES partner payload.\n\n    Triple-DES encryption is prohibited under current guidance.\n    \"\"\"\n    raise PermissionError(\"three-key Triple-DES encryption is disallowed after 2023\")\n",
